Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Slack for tessera.slack.com this month.

Slackbot, upgraded
Ask Slackbot to find a file, summarize a channel, or draft a message, in any conversation. It knows what you have access to and nothing else.

Workflow templates
Prebuilt workflows for new-hire onboarding, incident announcements, and weekly check-ins. Pick one, choose a channel, done.

Huddles 2.0
Screen sharing with multiple presenters, live captions, and an automatic huddle summary posted to the thread when you hang up.

Also: channel-level retention settings, and a redesigned mobile home tab.

See everything: https://email.slack.com/l/whats-new-0923

Thanks for using Slack,
